        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "अथास्य जज्ञिरे पुत्राः सत्यधर्मपरायणाः\nहविष्पन्दो मधुष्यन्दो दृढनेत्रो महारथः |",
      "iast": "atha asya jaGYire putrāḥ satya dharma parāyaṇāḥ\nhaviṣpando madhuṣyando dṛḍhanetro mahārathaḥ |",
      "translation": "\"Then Vishvamitra begot sons named Havispanda, Madhuspnada, Dhridhanetra and Mahaaratha, who conduct themselves in candour and chivalry.",
