    {
      "id": "1.57.4",
      "label": "1.57.4, 5",
      "numbers": [
        4,
        5
      ],
      "devanagari": "पूर्णे वर्षसहस्रे तु ब्रह्मा लोकपितामहः\nअब्रवीन्मधुरं वाक्यं विश्वामित्रं तपोधनम् |\nजिता राजर्षिलोकास्ते तपसा कुशिकात्मज",
      "iast": "pūrṇe varṣa sahasre tu brahmā loka pitāmahaḥ\nabravīt madhuram vākyam viśvāmitram tapo dhanam |\njitā rājarṣi lokāḥ te tapasā kuśika ātmaja",
      "translation": "\"At the close of one thousand years of ascesis Brahma, the Grandparent of all worlds, revealed Himself to Vishvamitra and spoke these words mellowly to ascetically wealthy Vishvamitra, 'oh, son of Kushika, Vishvamitra, you have won the worlds of kingly-sages by your ascesis.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "varSa sahasre puurNe",
          "iast": "varṣa sahasre pūrṇe",
          "devanagari": "वर्ष सहस्रे पूर्णे",
          "meaning": "years, thousand, at the close of",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "loka pitaamahaH brahmaa",
          "iast": "loka pitāmahaḥ brahmā",
          "devanagari": "लोक पितामहः ब्रह्मा",
          "meaning": "world's, grandparent, Brahma",
          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 4
        },
        {
          "itrans": "tapaH dhanam vishvaamitram",
          "iast": "tapaḥ dhanam viśvāmitram",
          "devanagari": "तपः धनं विश्वामित्रं",
          "meaning": "ascesis, wealthy, to Vishvamitra",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 10
        },
        {
