    {
      "id": "1.57.13",
      "label": "1.57.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "अशक्यमिति चाप्युक्तो वसिष्ठेन महात्मना |\nप्रत्याख्यातो वसिष्ठेन स ययौ दक्षिणां दिशम्\nततस्तत्कर्मसिद्ध्यर्थं पुत्रांस्तस्य गतो नृपः |",
      "iast": "aśakyam iti ca api ukto vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā |\npratyākhyāto vasiṣṭhena sa yayau dakṣiṇām diśam\ntataḥ tat karma siddhi artham putrān tasya gato nṛpaḥ |",
      "translation": "\"But the great-souled Vashishta said it as impossible. Thus repudiated Trishanku went to southerly direction in search of orchestrators for the purpose of realising that task, such a phantasmal ritual that enables him to go to heaven with his body, and that king hjas gone to the sons of Vashishta.",
