      "label": "1.57.14, 15",
      "numbers": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "वासिष्ठा दीर्घतपसस्तपो यत्र हि तेपिरे\nत्रिशंकुः सुमहातेजाः शतं परमभास्वरम् |\nवसिष्ठपुत्रान् ददृशे तप्यमानान् यशस्विनः",
      "iast": "vāsiṣṭhā dīrgha tapasaḥ tapo yatra hi tepire\ntriśaṅkuḥ sumahātejāḥ śatam parama bhāsvaram |\nvasiṣṭha putrān dadṛśe tapyamānān yaśasvinaḥ",
      "translation": "\"Trishanku has indeed gone to the place where the sons of Vashishta are protractedly expiating, and there he visited the hundred noble-souled sons of Vashishta, who are supremely self-luminescent and superbly self-refulgent by their ascesis.",
