          "anvayaIndex": 10,
          "verseIndex": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.57.17",
      "label": "1.57.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "शरणं वः प्रपद्येऽहं शरण्यान् शरणागतः\nप्रत्याख्यातोऽस्मि भद्रं वो वसिष्ठेन महात्मना |",
      "iast": "śaraṇam vaḥ prapadye aham śaraṇyān śaraṇāgataḥ\npratyākhyāto asmi bhadram vo vasiṣṭhena mahātmanā |",
      "translation": "\" 'I have come as a shelter-seeker seeking the shelter of yours as you are the shelterers of the needy, you all be safe, as the great-souled Vashishta has repudiated me.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
