          "iast": "vaḥ bhadram",
          "devanagari": "वः भद्रं",
          "meaning": "to you, let safety be there",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": null
        },
        {
          "itrans": "mahaatmanaa vasiSThena pratyaakhyaataH asmi",
          "iast": "mahātmanā vasiṣṭhena pratyākhyātaḥ asmi",
          "devanagari": "महात्मना वसिष्ठेन प्रत्याख्यातः अस्मि",
          "meaning": "by great-souled, Vashishta, repudiated, I am.",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1.57.18",
      "label": "1.57.18",
      "numbers": [
        18
      ],
      "devanagari": "यष्टुकामो महायज्ञं तदनुज्ञातुमर्हथ\nगुरुपुत्रानहं सर्वान्नमस्कृत्य प्रसादये |",
      "iast": "yaṣṭu kāmo mahāyaGYam tat anuGYātum arthatha\nguru putrān aham sarvān namas kṛtya prasādaye |",
      "translation": "\" 'I am longing to perform an unusual ritual and it will be apt of you to give assent to it. Reverencing all of the sons of my mentor Vashishta I am proposing this to you.",
      "notes": [],
